 TO NEW JERSEY THEM TO MINNESOTA, THEN SOLD AGAN IN 2008 INTO TORONTO ONTARIO WHERE I BOUGHT IN 2012 FROM A TORONTO LAWYER B5 BILL {NICKNAME}. ... #mcacn#mcacn_show#mcacnshow#musclecars#musclecar#mcacn2025#plymouth#plymouthcuda#vcode'#classof1970#ncminsurance\n2 notes · View notes\n\nmcacnshow · 1 year ago\n\nText\n\nImage: Tumblr media\n\nTHE STORY BEHIND THE 1970 CUDA\n\n                                                                                                                           ONE OF CHRYSLER'S MOST DESIRABLE MUSCLE CARS,THE 1970 PLYMOUTH CUDA 440-6 BBL,WITH ONLY 1755 V-CODES BUILT IN 1970, 902 WERE 4-SPEEDS  AND 853 WERE AUTOMATICS. THIS CUDA BEING ONE OF 853 AUTOMATIC V-CODES BUILT FOR 1970. THIS CUDA IS #157 OF 320 BUILT IN VIN SEQUENCE FOR 1970 V-CODES. 1970 WAS THE START OF THE E BODY CUDA UNTIL 1974                                                                                                                                    THIS CUDA HAS BEEN DOCUMENTED AND CERTIFIED BY GALEN V. GOVIER WITH COMPLETE REPORT VERIFYING IT IS A TRUE NUMBERS MATCHING 1970 V-CODE CUDA INCLUDING COMPLETE DRIVE TRAIN. CAR HAS 71,000 ORIGINAL MILES.\n\n CAR WAS BUILT ON NOVEMBER 5 1969  IN HAMTRAMEK MICHIGAN SOLD NEW IN USA  AFTERWARDS SOLD AGAIN AND WENT TO OTTAWA ONTARIO,CAR CHANGED HANDS A FEW TIMES AGAIN GOING BACK TO NEW JERSEY THEM TO MINNESOTA, THEN SOLD AGAN IN 2008 INTO TORONTO ONTARIO WHERE I BOUGHT IN 2012 FROM A TORONTO LAWYER B5 BILL {NICKNAME}. IN 2013 BEGAIN A  COMPLETE10 YEAR ROTISSERIE RESTORATION ,ALL METAL WORK & FABRICATION DONE BY JEEF CABOT,CAR PAINTED BT DAVE BRIGHTON, ASSEMBLY & RESTORATION DONE MOSTLY BY MAURO BROCCA  & MYSELF.THE CUDA WAS DONE WITH ALL ORGINAL & NOS PARTS.                                                                                                        RESTORATION WAS COMPLETE IN EARLY 2023,THE CUDA GRACED MULTIPLE CAR SHOWS,THE RESTORATION WAS SO IMPECCABLE THAT THE CAR CLINCHED FIRST PLACE AWARDS AT EVERY EVENT IT ENTERED..ITS EXCELLENCE WAS FUTHER ACKNOWLEDGED WHEN IT WAS CHOSEN FOR THE MUSCLE CAR CATEGORY AT THE PRESTIGIOUS COBBLE BEACH CONCIURS D'ELEGANCE SHOW WHERE IT TRIUMPHED ONCE AGAIN WINNING FIRST PLACE IN ITS CLASS OF MUSCLE CARS.THIS WAS A GREAT INCREDIBLE HONOUR TO RECEIVE SUCH RECOGNITION IT MADE IT WORTH  ALL THE HARD WORK & COSTS,,TOTAL SATISFACTION !!!\n\nDonato Ciaccia, CANADA\n\n1970 Plymouth 'cuda V Code\n\nMCACN 2025 Class of 1970 Sponsored by NCM Insurance\n\n@ncminsurance\n\n#mcacn#mcacn_show#mcacnshow#musclecars#musclecar#mcacn2025#plymouth#plymouthcuda#vcode'#classof1970#ncminsurance\n\n5 notes · View notes\n\nmcacnshow · 1 year ago\n\nText\n\nImage: Tumblr media\n\nMCACN 2025 Class of 1970 Sponsored by NCM Insurance\n\nJason & Maureen Heinecke\n\n1970 Olds 442 W30 with Canadian Docs\n\n@ncminsurance\n\n#mcacn#mcacn_show#mcacnshow#musclecars#musclecar#mcacn2025#classof1970#ncminsurance\n\n2 notes · View notes\n\nmcacnshow · 1 year ago\n\nText\n\nImage: Tumblr media\n\nHow about a bit of \"Before and After\" of a car you will see at the upcoming Muscle Car and Corvette Nationals show in our Class of 1970 Invitational, Sponsored by NCM Insurance.\n\nThis '70 Judge has come a long way, thanks to restorer Bill Brunker. Be sure to check it out when we return to the Donald E. Stephens Convention Center in Rosemont, (SUBURBAN Chicago) Illinois, November 22-23.\n\nNot to soon to book your rooms now at one of our SEVEN Official Host Hotels, all offering great rates + special MCACN exclusive extra perks! www.mcacn.com/hotels\n\n#mcacn#mcacn_show#mcacnshow#musclecars#musclecar#mcacn2025#PontiacGTO#GTOJudge#billbrunker#MCACNClassof1970#ncminsurance\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nObjekterkennung in Echtzeit Auf Dem Neuesten Stand Der Technik! YOLOv13 Erweitert Die Globalen Erkennungsfähigkeiten; UltraHR-100K Wurde Für Die NeurIPS 2025 Ausgewählt Und Ermöglicht Die Erfassung Von Texturbildern in Ultrahoher Auflösung. | Neuigkeiten | HyperAI (https://hyper.ai/de/news/46223)\nciteturn2369search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 months ago; Link zum Artikel:https://go.hyper.ai/bG6b5 ... VCode: Ein multimodaler Codierungs-Benchmark mit SVG als symbolischer visueller Darstellung\n\nLink zum Artikel:https://go.hyper.ai/xNU6P\n\n4. OS-Sentinel: Auf dem Weg zu sichereren mobilen GUI-Agenten durch hybride Validierung in realistischen Arbeitsabläufen\n\nIn diesem Beitrag wird ein neuartiges hybrides Sicherheitserkennungsframework namens OS-Sentinel vorgestellt, das explizite Verstöße auf Systemebene mittels eines formalen Verifizierers erkennt und gleichzeitig Kontextrisiken und Stellvertreterverhalten mithilfe eines VLM-basierten Kontextbeurteilers bewertet.\n\nLink zum Artikel:https://go.hyper.ai/bG6b5\n\n5. VCode: Ein multimodaler Codierungs-Benchmark mit SVG als symbolischer visueller Darstellung\n\nDiese Arbeit stellt VCode vor – ein Benchmark-Framework, das multimodales Verständnis in eine Codegenerierungsaufgabe umwandelt: Ausgehend von einem Bild muss das Modell SVG-Code generieren, der die symbolische Semantik für nachfolgende Inferenzprozesse bewahrt. Das Framework deckt drei Bereiche ab: allgemeines Alltagsverständnis (MM-Vet), fachspezifisches Wissen (MMMU) und Aufgaben mit Fokus auf visuelle Wahrnehmung (CV-Bench).\n\nLink zum Artikel:https://go.hyper.ai/UNmqK\n\nWeitere Artikel zu den Grenzen der KI:https://go.hyper.ai/iSYSZ\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAcacia Research Corporation (https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/934549/000101968706000581/acacia_10k-123105.htm)\nciteturn2369search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 20.6 years ago; Crawled: 3 weeks ago; VCode Holdings, Inc. and VData, LLC v. ... In October 2005, all V-chip related litigation activities were concluded with no material impact on our financial position, results of operations or cash flows.\nVCode Holdings, Inc. and VData, LLC v. U.S. Bank National Associ